# Orthanc and the packages it needs that Raspberry Pi OS Trixie (desktop) doesn't have,
# pinned. They ship inside each release and are installed from those files, never
# downloaded on a Pi. Fetched by tools/release/fetch_debs.sh; checksums in debs.lock.
